                "text": "The weather in San Francisco is currently about 22°C (72°F) and windy. Here are some clothing suggestions:\n\n1. **Light Layering**: A lightweight jacket or windbreaker would be ideal due to the wind.\n2. **Tops**: A comfortable t-shirt or long-sleeve shirt works well.\n3. **Bottoms**: Jeans, chinos, or comfortable shorts, depending on your preference.\n4. **Shoes**: Comfortable shoes for walking, like sneakers or sandals.\n5. **Accessories**: Consider a hat to shield against wind, and maybe sunglasses.\n\nEnjoy your time in San Francisco!"
